  "No request controls": "没有请求控件",
  "A kwarg is an extra value sent with every request, such as enable_thinking or reasoning_effort. Each one can also surface as a control in the model picker.": "kwarg 是随每次请求发送的额外值，例如 enable_thinking 或 reasoning_effort。每一个也可以在模型选择器中显示为控件。",
